<title>FRANCE: Car bomb in Algeria kills four, injures 27.</title>
<headline>Car bomb in Algeria kills four, injures 27.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algerian security forces said on Friday a car bomb went off in Boumerdes, 40 km (25 miles) east of Algiers, killing four people and injuring 27.</p>
<p>The official news agency APS, quoting a security forces statement, said the explosion was on Thursday night, near a restaurant.</p>
